Shout-out to two people who made last week's warehouse pilot work.

@MaraEllingsen from Harbor & Finch reworked the intake checklist with our crew over two days, catching the label mismatch that blocked 60 kits.

@JonasLindqvist from Driftlane lent us three spare scanners and stayed late Thursday to test the sync fix.

The pilot cleared 412 kits with zero mispicks because of them. Thank you both.
